    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1130">

                <pb facs="1110" n="944" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg944"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/21462</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Collector Cobb to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">El Paso</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-11-15T09:00:00-07:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 15, 1917, 9 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>For Polk. My November 14, 11 a.m. Villistas captured Ojinaga last night. Three
                    hundred Carrancistas with arms surrendered to Americans.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cobb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
